<title>FRANCE: Canal Plus Sept subscribers up 13.4 pct.</title>
<headline>Canal Plus Sept subscribers up 13.4 pct.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-11-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Subscriber base at Sept 30.</p>
<p>    TOTAL				7,776,078   vs   6,857,371</p>
<p>    France individuals	     4,140,945   vs   3,969,453</p>
<p>    France collectives		 257,443   vs     243,611</p>
<p>    Canalsatellite France	    357,955   vs     280,063</p>
<p>    Canalsatellite Spain		84,575   vs	30,493</p>
<p>    Belgium				177,492   vs     163,262</p>
<p>    Spain				1,323,099   vs   1,117,722</p>
<p>    Germany			    1,253,237   vs     936,453</p>
<p>    Africa				 109,884   vs	89,295</p>
<p>    Poland				  71,448   vs	27,019</p>
<p>NOTE - Canal Plus gave the figures in a statement.</p>
</text>
